WEBVTT

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.120
<i>That day, they shone dazzlingly bright,</i>

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.610
<i>wrapped the people in a vortex of excitement,</i>

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.110
<i>and ST☆RISH was born amidst splendor.</i>

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:25.820
<i>It would someday come to be known as their legendary debut concert.</i>

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.190
<i>They have begun walking towards their dream.</i>

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:17.990
<i>Dear Grandmother,</i>

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:22.420
<i>Having graduated from the performing arts school Saotome Academy</i>

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.420
<i>and making our debut,</i>

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:28.170
<i>we are now fully engaged in the performing arts scene.</i>

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:31.530
Haruka!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:33.670
Over here!

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:35.420
Tomo!

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.060
It's good to see you again!

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:41.850
How have you been?

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.720
I missed you.

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:44.980
<i>Even my roommate Shibuya Tomochika has debuted,</i>

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:49.310
<i>and she is getting work already.</i>

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.880
<i>That's right. We are no longer students.</i>

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.350
<i>We are professionals.</i>

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.390
This is the agency...

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:03.160
Isn't this your own agency?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.920
Why are you getting so nervous?

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.370
Come on! Go and get 'em!

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.710
Good morning. I'm Nanami Haruka.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:17.930
Um...

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.040
Oh, you're here for the Master Course, right?

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:20.890
Yes.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.590
I'm sorry, but would you mind using this map to get there?

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.450
What? Oh, okay.

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:34.090
Haruka, I'll come back once I'm finished with work.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:37.290
I'm sure organizing your stuff will be difficult on your own.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.560
Thanks.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.050
See you later!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.570
See you later!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:48.060
<i>The Shining Agency has a system to support newbies who have just debuted...</i>

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:50.990
<i>The Master Course.</i>

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:54.950
<i>Tomo, all the members of ST☆RISH,</i>

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.100
<i>and I have become members of the Master Course</i>

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:00.010
<i>and are engaging in show business, but...</i>

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:06.140
Let's see. I think the Master Course dormitory is around here somewhere, but...

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.590
Could I be...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.080
Lost?!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.700
What am I going to do?

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.350
Even if I wanted to ask for directions, there isn't a policeman around.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.780
Nanami.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.890
H-Help me!

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:30.040
It's me. It's me, Otoya.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.090
Ittoki?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.350
You scared me.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:38.370
Are you okay? Were you lost?

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.430
How did you know?

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.410
You're going to the dorm, right?

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.160
Just follow this path straight ahead.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.520
Thanks.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:48.730
I'm looking forward to this.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:49.130
Huh?

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:55.010
I'll get to sing lots of your songs as a professional from now on.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.960
Ittoki...

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.820
On top of that, we'll be living in the same dorm,

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:00.680
and we'll get to see each other every day...

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.550
N-Not that I meant anything weird by that.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:07.430
I'm going to do my best!

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.080
I'll sing better than I ever have before!

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:11.650
Nanami.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.530
Let's both work hard together.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.490
Okay.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:20.000
All right! I'm getting pumped up!

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.420
Oh, no! I have business at the agency!

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:25.910
See you later, Nanami!

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.510
Okay.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:36.400
Nanami!

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.060
Shou!

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.570
You look like you're doing well.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.400
Did you watch that DVD?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.440
Huh? Oh, yes!

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:51.680
"The Prince of Fighting" was great!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:55.720
I know, right? I knew you'd get it.

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.990
I'll return it to you right away.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.330
You can have it.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.210
What? But...

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.750
It's okay. Keep it.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.580
I want you to keep it, Nanami.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:11.890
I want you to keep what I love most...

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.820
There's actually more, and it's amazing.

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.850
It's about Mr. Hyuga as the Fighting Prince.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:23.090
He takes on a million guys by himself.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.520
Really?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.200
Fairy!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.500
Shinomiya, wait.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:47.500
I missed you, Fairy!

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.680
Let go of her, Natsuki! You're bothering her!

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:53.690
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.580
You're just so cute I thought you were a fairy.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.300
A fairy?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:05.490
Yes, one of the cherry blossom fairies that I read about in a picture book during my childhood.

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:08.110
I'm sure you were just dreaming while taking a nap!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.950
I don't care if it is a dream...

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:15.490
Let's keep making wonderful music together, Haru.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.000
Okay.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:23.590
Ouch...

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:26.810
I'm sorry!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.000
Ichinose?

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.350
You haven't changed.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.130
I-I'm sorry...

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.670
Ichinose, have you moved in yet?

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.290
I'm just getting started.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.140
I'll never finish today if I don't get moving...

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.040
Do you need something?

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.160
N-No, nothing...

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:02.810
My mistake. I'm still accustomed to speaking harshly to you, as well.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:08.230
We're both professionals now.

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:09.710
Let's give it everything we have.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:13.690
Okay.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:23.390
Huh? It's open.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.230
Excuse me...

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:28.570
A man?!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:31.860
I-I'm sorry! I'm in the wrong room!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.760
Did I accidentally come to the men's dorm?

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.450
Huh? It's my room...

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:46.470
Hijirikawa?

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:52.930
I'm sorry. The movers asked me to show them to your room.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.690
It was so dirty, I couldn't help myself.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.420
I see.

00:08:56.420 --> 00:09:00.130
I-I mean, you didn't need to clean my room.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.470
Don't worry about it.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.400
I even tuned your piano.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:08.040
If you need help with anything, just ask.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.580
Um, Hijirikawa.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:13.710
What is it?

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:20.520
I look forward to working with you again.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.350
I look forward to it as well.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.120
Yes.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:36.550
<i>The time I spend with you is both delightful and painful.</i>

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:42.170
<i>I must do something to stem these overflowing emotions...</i>

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.520
Good morning.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:58.200
You're as beautiful as ever, Little Lamb.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.220
Jinguji?

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.950
Did you grow these, Jinguji?

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:05.130
It's a new type I grew in my rose garden.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:07.500
I call it "Lady Haruka."

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:10.880
It's a rose that blooms for only you and me.

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:14.840
I want to wrap you in its sweet scent,

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.680
and make you feel my passionate love all night long.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:23.490
Our new life together starts today.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:25.780
It's a day to remember...

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:33.720
You're so cute. I'm just saying hello.

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:38.270
H-Hello?

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:45.130
<i>Grandmother, the Master Course is too intense for me.</i>

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:50.070
I'm so excited.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.520
Just like our days at the academy...

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:55.040
Our new life is beginning.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.550
Under the same roof as the Little Lamb.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.770
Oh, you're so serious. Don't be so mad.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.830
What were you just thinking about?

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:14.950
I-I wasn't thinking about anything.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.860
I was just thinking I'm happy to be with Nanami...

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:22.900
Otoya, as idols, we're forbidden to love.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.700
If you break that rule, you'll be fired.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:28.370
Oh, come on. I know that much!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.500
You're not taking this seriously enough.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.160
Our practice room is huge. This place is great.

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:34.620
I like it too.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:39.120
I'm so, so happy to be living here with Haru.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:42.510
W-With? Isn't the women's dorm on a different floor?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.690
But we'll be sleeping under the same roof.

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:47.410
I'm so happy.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.220
I see there's someone else getting carried away right here.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.970
This is where you've all been.

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:57.190
There's something I want to give you...

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:02.940
This is...

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:04.910
Are they all different songs?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.710
You composed six songs?

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:10.280
Good work, Little Lamb. I couldn't ask for a better present.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:14.150
These songs came to life when I thought of each of you.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:17.960
This is amazing. I can't believe you gave us songs.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:21.330
We've got to write lyrics worthy of the music.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.300
Thank you, Haru.

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:30.100
This voice...

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.740
Could it be?

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:38.180
Happy idols share pure love!

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.610
When did you get here?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:48.870
Boys, welcome to the Master Course.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.580
Principal... I mean, President.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:56.530
Your debut concert was wonderful.

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:58.760
Th-Thank you very much.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:00.000
But!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:06.340
The reality is, many bloom splendidly and fade like fireworks.

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:12.180
Only the devoted can become actual stars shining in the night sky.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:16.140
Allow me to introduce you to someone essential to helping you accomplish that!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.020
Who?

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:22.850
Show yourselves...

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.820
Pioneering princes!

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.890
These guys are here...

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.250
At the Master Course.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:40.790
They're supposed to help us?

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:01.260
Amazing!

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:03.930
This song... This dance...

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.030
Not bad.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.740
These are... professionals.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:25.670
They changed into real people!

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:29.860
Anyway, I must prepare for the entrance ceremony!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:32.520
Work hard. Thank you!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:34.620
"Thank you"?

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.890
Thanks for waiting, everyone.

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:41.890
Good morning.

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:44.900
Rin! Your outfit is sparkling!

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:48.650
It's a shame you're a man.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.860
Even Mr. Hyuga is sparkling...

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.550
You're no longer students,

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:59.190
but rather professionals trying to make it in the world of performing arts.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.120
You've got to learn on your own and improve yourselves.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.860
But I'm sure there are plenty of things you don't know or are worried about.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:11.880
Which is why we've assigned them to help you.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.120
Hello.

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:15.080
So this is what the Master Course is about.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.300
Kotobuki Reiji is assigned to Oto and Tokiya.

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.020
Nice to meet you.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.350
Kurosaki Ranmaru is assigned to Jinguji and Hijirikawa.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:29.130
Mikaze Ai is assigned to Shou and Na.

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:35.430
Haru, if there's anything bothering you, come talk to me.

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:36.750
Okay.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:42.040
Let's work hard to become universally acknowledged professionals!

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.650
What kind of outfit is that?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.720
I didn't know we would have seniors assigned to us.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.550
I'm grateful we have someone to teach us.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:57.140
I'm so glad I came to the Master Course.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.500
You guys aren't anything special.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:04.010
You won't make it far in this world if you rely on others.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.970
What's wrong, Ran-Ran?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:10.260
We're only doing this because the president told us to.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:13.520
Ai doesn't look like he cares either.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:17.990
You're right. I'm interested in them as test subjects though.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.960
What test?

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:24.860
Kurosaki, we're not approaching this halfhearted.

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:26.550
What?

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.180
We're prepared.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:33.540
Besides, I think we can beat that song of yours.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:37.040
Are you trying to start a fight?

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.310
Bring it on.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.030
Now, now.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.300
To become a universally acknowledged professional,

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:45.960
you need the guts to defy your seniors.

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:53.820
They don't look like they've got the will to me.

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:57.460
I don't have any desire to teach you.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:06.340
It seems we'll have to do what we can ourselves.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.580
If we really get stuck, we've got a senior

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:12.480
in the entertainment business right here.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.200
Right, Ichi?

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.340
Huh?

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.030
Ichinose Tokiya...

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:19.010
You had a lot of work as <i>Hayato</i>.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.390
I agree that a person should fend for himself.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.020
What? You too?

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:30.020
You're right. If you want to get stronger, you have to do it yourself.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.320
Shou.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:36.450
All you have to do is keep an eye on us.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.100
What? Really?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:44.950
That's too bad. I was hoping to learn a lot from Kotobuki.

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:47.730
Kotobuki?

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.500
Call me Rei, Otoyan.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:52.980
Otoyan?

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:54.950
And Toki.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.120
Toki? That name...

00:17:57.440 --> 00:18:01.060
We'll try to stay out of your business just like you've requested,

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.790
but you can ask us anything.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.750
After all, we'll be sharing a room.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:05.810
Sharing a room?

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.200
Mr. Shining didn't tell you?

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:11.900
Your seniors in the Master Course live with you.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:14.690
You live with us?!

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:18.530
My belongings have been pushed into a corner.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.660
Your beds are over there.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:24.450
Wh-What is this?!

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:27.250
Bunk beds are good enough for newbies.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.710
My tatami is gone!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.260
It was taking up too much room, so I threw it out.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:33.060
I'm the master of this room.

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:36.990
If you're going to talk, wait until after you've become a real pro.

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:42.390
Don't come on this side of the door.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.890
Make sure you stay away from me when I'm sleeping.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.600
Okay.

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.660
Wh-What?

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.890
You really are short, aren't you?

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.610
This already?!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:58.370
My data says you're 161 centimeters, but you look about 100 to me.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.970
Shut up! What's your problem?!

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:02.740
Shou, calm down.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.870
You don't seem to know how to respect your seniors.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:11.860
I'll set a schedule to help you learn some discipline.

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:14.920
Wake up at 5 o'clock?!

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:17.840
5:02, get changed! 5:07, wash face!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:18.930
5:08, prepare for breakfast!

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:22.040
5:23, breakfast! 5:43, clean up!

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.040
It's so detailed and artistic.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.320
9:00, go to bed!

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:23.800
So early!

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:27.430
If either of you are late, you'll both be responsible.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:30.740
I can't keep this strict schedule...

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:36.810
Tomo, what is the Master Course like?

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.800
It's so hard!

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:41.610
My seniors are strict, and I've got my own work to deal with.

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:44.030
Every day makes my head spin.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:48.740
Thanks for coming even though you're so busy.

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:51.830
You helped me move too.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:58.300
I wish we could live together, but I was assigned to live in the senior's apartment.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:58.960
Sorry.

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:03.130
It's okay. I've got to work hard too.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:10.190
I was unbelievably happy to have ST☆RISH sing my songs.

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:16.230
But I realized I can't be satisfied with that.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:25.190
I've always wanted to write something like the songs that captivated me...

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:31.750
I'm sure you can do it.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.040
I'm sure you can, Haruka...

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:38.490
Thanks, Tomo...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.780
Well, see you later.

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.510
Yeah, thanks.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:01.560
<i>Beautiful flowers...</i>

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:09.420
<i>Receiving life from one stem, they bloom impressively.</i>

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:13.040
Cecil...

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:19.090
Kuppuru?

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:34.270
Fireflies? It's just like that time.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:50.450
<i>Grandmother, a strange encounter that would change</i>

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:54.440
<i>my destiny was waiting for me there.</i>

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:01.570
Cecil!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:21.430
I am pleased to have met you again, my beloved princess...
